  "title": "Audi TT 8N: A Timeless Icon",
  "script": "Looking for a stylish, affordable sports car? The first-generation Audi TT, known as the 8N, might be your perfect match. Launched in 1998, this design icon offers a blend of performance and practicality.\n\nUnder the hood, the 8N features a 1.8-liter turbocharged engine. Depending on the model, it delivers between 180 and 225 horsepower, providing a spirited driving experience.\n\nMost 8N TTs come equipped with Audi's quattro all-wheel-drive system. This setup ensures excellent traction and handling, making it a joy to drive in various conditions.\n\nCompared to its contemporaries, the 8N TT stands out for its unique Bauhaus-inspired design and solid build quality. It's a head-turner that doesn't compromise on reliability.\n\nFor enthusiasts, the 1.8T engine offers significant tuning potential. With the right modifications, you can safely boost power and torque, enhancing the car's performance.\n\nSo, is the Audi TT 8N the right blend of style and performance for you?",
